Likewise, it is easy to check that the form \(\tilde{b}(.,.)\) satisfies the weak inf-sup condition:

\[\sup_{v\in\tilde{X}}(\tilde{b}(v,\boldsymbol{\mu})/\|v\|_{\tilde{X}})\geq\| \boldsymbol{\mu}\|_{0,\Omega}\ \ \ \ \ \forall\boldsymbol{\mu}\in\tilde{M}.\]

Finally, we readily derive that here the Lagrange multiplier \(\lambda\) satisfies \(\lambda=v\omega\).

_Remark 5.1_.: Observe the analogy between Problem (5.7) and Problem (2.20) in two dimensions.

